//File:    test_limits.jtext
//Date:    2026-10-30
//Purpose: Human-editable seed for per-test control parameters (v002).
//
// Values here are loaded into the results.db testControl table at the start of runs
// (see main.cpp + shared/jac313_results_db.hpp).
// The DB is the runtime/authoritative store for these test control values.
// (Not kept in source code or consulted directly at runtime.)
//
// test_control: one row per test.
//   test         the test name; keep it an exact match to what add_test registers
//   timeout_sec  0 = no timeout (not recommended for smokes)
//   memory_mb    0 = no limit
//
// Used to populate timeouts/failsafes so that test behavior is data-driven from the DB.
//
=== jText File ===
 1. ?# test_limits.jtext
