=== Fields ===
 1. /# id/Integer/Not Null
 2. /# test/String/Not Null/Not Empty            # the name add_test registers
 3. /# timeout_sec/Integer/Not Null              # 0 = none
 4. /# memory_mb/Integer/Not Null                # 0 = none
=== End Fields ===
